{"id": "11th_tamil_u6_q122", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "supplementary_isaitthamizhar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mkt_chinthamani_record", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1937-இல் வெளியாகி ஓராண்டுக்கும் மேலாகத் தொடர்ந்து ஓடி, பாகவதரின் புகழைத் தமிழகமெங்கும் பட்டிதொட்டியெங்கும் பரவச் செய்த திரைப்படம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பவளக்கொடி", "B": "சிந்தாமணி", "C": "ஹரிதாஸ்", "D": "அசோக்குமார்"}, "explanation": "1937-இல் வெளியான 'சிந்தாமணி' திரைப்படம் ஓராண்டுக்கும் மேலாக ஓடிச் சாதனை படைத்தது; பாகவதர் பாடிய 'ராதே உனக்கு கோபம் ஆகாதடி' பாடல் நாடெங்கும் எதிரொலித்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which 1937 blockbuster ran for over a year and made M. K. Thyagaraja Bhagavathar a household sensation across Tamil Nadu?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Pavazhakkodi", "B": "Chinthamani", "C": "Haridas", "D": "Ashok Kumar"}, "explanation": "'Chinthamani' (1937) ran for more than a year, establishing Bhagavathar as a preeminent icon."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 139, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 139", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 6", "Supplementary", "M. K. Thyagaraja Bhagavathar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u6_q123", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "supplementary_isaitthamizhar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thiruvilaiyadal_song", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1965-இல் வெளியான 'திருவிளையாடல்' திரைப்படத்தில் ஔவையாராகத் தோன்றி, 'பழம் நீயப்பா ஞானப்பழம் நீயப்பா' என்ற அமர கீதத்தைப் பாடியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எம். எஸ். சுப்புலட்சுமி", "B": "டி. கே. பட்டம்மாள்", "C": "கே. பி. சுந்தராம்பாள்", "D": "எஸ். ஜானகி"}, "explanation": "'திருவிளையாடல்' திரைப்படத்தில் கே. பி. சுந்தராம்பாள் முருகன் மீது பாடிய 'பழம் நீயப்பா ஞானப்பழம் நீயப்பா' பாடல் தமிழர்களின் நெஞ்சில் அழியாச் சுடராக நிலைத்துள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the 1965 classic 'Thiruvilaiyadal', who sang the timeless devotional song 'Pazham Neeyappa Gnanappazham Neeyappa'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "M. S. Subbulakshmi", "B": "D. K. Pattammal", "C": "K. B. Sundarambal", "D": "S. Janaki"}, "explanation": "K. B. Sundarambal sang the iconic devotional song 'Pazham Neeyappa' in Thiruvilaiyadal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 138", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 6", "Supplementary", "K. B. Sundarambal"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u6_q124", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "supplementary_isaitthamizhar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tamil_isai_movement", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ராஜா சர் அண்ணாமலை செட்டியார் அவர்களால் தொடங்கப்பட்ட 'தமிழிசை இயக்கத்திற்கு' (Tamil Isai Movement) மேடைகளில் முழு மூச்சாகத் தமிழ்ப் பாடல்களைப் பாடிப் பேராதரவு தந்த இசை மேதைகள் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செம்மங்குடி சீனிவாச ஐயர்", "B": "ஜி. என். பாலசுப்பிரமணியம்", "C": "அரியக்குடி ராமானுஜ ஐயங்கார்", "D": "எம். கே. தியாகராஜ பாகவதர் மற்றும் கே. பி. சுந்தராம்பாள்"}, "explanation": "தமிழிசை மாநாடுகளிலும் கச்சேரிகளிலும் தமிழ்ப் பாடல்களையே முதன்மையாகப் பாடித் தமிழிசை இயக்கத்தின் வெற்றிக்குப் பெரும் பங்காற்றியவர்கள் தியாகராஜ பாகவதரும் கே. பி. சுந்தராம்பாளும் ஆவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which musical giants vigorously championed the Tamil Isai Movement founded by Raja Sir Annamalai Chettiar by performing exclusively Tamil songs?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Semmangudi Srinivasa Iyer", "B": "G. N. Balasubramaniam", "C": "Ariyakudi Ramanuja Iyengar", "D": "M. K. Thyagaraja Bhagavathar and K. B. Sundarambal"}, "explanation": "Bhagavathar and Sundarambal played leading roles in propagating the Tamil Isai Movement across the state."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 139, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 139", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Unit 6", "Supplementary", "Tamil Isai Movement"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_u6_q125", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "supplementary_isaitthamizhar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kbs_national_award", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கே. பி. சுந்தராம்பாளின் கலைச் சேவையைப் பாராட்டி இந்திய அரசு அவருக்கு வழங்கிய உயரிய குடிமக்கள் விருது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பத்மஸ்ரீ விருது (1970)", "B": "பத்ம பூஷண்", "C": "பாரத ரத்னா", "D": "பத்ம விபூஷண்"}, "explanation": "கே. பி. சுந்தராம்பாளுக்கு 1970-ஆம் ஆண்டு இந்திய அரசு 'பத்மஸ்ரீ' விருது வழங்கிச் சிறப்பித்தது; இவர் தமிழக அரசின் கலைமாமணி விருதினையும் பெற்றவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which civilian honor was conferred upon K. B. Sundarambal by the Government of India in 1970?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Padma Shri (1970)", "B": "Padma Bhushan", "C": "Bharat Ratna", "D": "Padma Vibhushan"}, "explanation": "She was conferred the prestigious Padma Shri award in 1970."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 138, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit 6, Page 138", "url": null, "sour