{"id": "11th_tamil_u6_q169", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_6", "lesson_id": "glossary_and_pyq", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "glossary_matching_art", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்காணும் கலைச்சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் தமிழாக்கத்தையும் பொருத்துக:\n(அ) Aesthetics - 1. கல்வெட்டியல்\n(ஆ) Artifacts - 2. அழகியல் (முருகியல்)\n(இ) Architecture - 3. கலைப்பொருட்கள் (கலைப் படைப்புகள்)\n(ஈ) Epigraphy - 4. கட்டிடக்கலை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-1", "B": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-2, ஆ-4, இ-3, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "Aesthetics - அழகியல் (2); Artifacts - கலைப்பொருட்கள் (3); Architecture - கட்டிடக்கலை (4); Epigraphy - கல்வெட்டியல் (1). சரியான வரிசை: 2, 3, 4, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the architectural and aesthetic terms with their Tamil translations:\n(a) Aesthetics - 1. Epigraphy\n(b) Artifacts - 2. Aesthetics (Azhagiyal)\n(c) Architecture - 3. Artifacts (Kalaip porutkal)\n(d) Epigraphy - 4. Architecture (Kattadakkalai)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "B": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-2, b-4, c-3, d-1"}, "explanation": "Matching: Aesthetics (2), Artifacts (3), Architecture (4), Epigraphy (1). Sequence: 2, 3, 4, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_a